UE = M IF COUNT(EnergySource WITHOUT [95]) = 1\r\nR2b:VALUE IN [B, F, D] IF COUNT(EnergySource WITHOUT [95]) > 1\r\nR2c:VALUE IS ABSENT IF @FullyElectricVehicle IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'对not fully electric vehicles：当车型=Mx, Nx, Lx 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填 FuelType = M where all EnergySources are the same. Not counting Electricity (95) FuelType = B, F,D  where not all EnergySources are the same. Not counting Electricity (95)  禁止 for fully electric vehicles 当车型=Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','maxLength=1','26.1.','DIRECT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统','c54550c5-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(3602,341,'MaximumNetPowerCombustion','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT IF @EngineCapacity IS PRESENT\r\nR2:VALUE IS ABSENT IF @EngineCapacity IS ABSENT','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Lx, Tx, Cx for the EnergyConvertor with an EngineCapacity 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）, V时必填  禁止 for the EnergyConvertor where EngineCapacity has no value 当车型=Ox, Rx, Sx时禁止','totalDigits=6; fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=9999.99','27.1','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统','c54d5caa-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(3604,343,'EngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMin','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT\r\nR2:VALUE IS ABSENT IF @EngineCapacity IS ABSENT','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Lx for the EnergyConvertor with an EngineCapacity时必填 and EngineSpeedMaximumNetPower has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）, V EngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMin < EngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMax  禁止 for the EnergyConvertor where EngineSpeedMaximumNetPower has a value 当车型=Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止 禁止 for the EnergyConvertor where EngineCapacity has no value','min=0.0; max=99999','27.1.',NULL,34,'VALUE IS PRESENT',NULL,'c55817d4-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(3605,344,'EngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMax','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,NULL,'N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Lx for the EnergyConvertor with an EngineCapacity时必填 and EngineSpeedMaximumNetPower has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）, VEngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMax > EngineSpeedMaximumNetPowerMin  禁止 for the EnergyConvertor where EngineSpeedMaximumNetPower has a value 当车型=Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止 禁止 for the EnergyConvertor where EngineCapacity has no value','min=0.0; max=99999','27.1.',NULL,34,NULL,NULL,'c55b8536-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(3607,46,'ConsolidatedMaximumNetPowerElectric','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL COUNT(@EnergySources, @EnergySource IN [95]) < 2','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx with multiple EnergySource Electricity (95) 且 no value specified in ConsolidatedMaximum30MinutesPower时必填  当车型=Mx, Nx with one EnergySource Electricity (95)时禁止 当车型=Mx, Nx with no EnergySource Electricity (95)时禁止 当车型= Ox, Lx, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','totalDigits=6; fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=9999.99','27.3.',NULL,34,'AGGREGATE','认证系统','c5645935-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(3609,45,'ConsolidatedMaximum30MinutesPower','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @X IS ABSENT AND COUNT(@EnergySources, @EnergySource IN [95]) > 1\r\nR2:VALUE IS ABSENT IF COUNT(@EnergySource IN [95]) < 2','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx with multiple EnergySource Electricity (95)  且 no value specified in ConsolidatedMaximumNetPowerElectric时必填  当车型=Mx, Nx with one EnergySource Electricity (95)时禁止 当车型=Mx, Nx with no EnergySource Electricity (95)时禁止 当车型= Ox, Lx, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','totalDigits=6; fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=9999.99','27.4.',NULL,34,'AGGREGATE','认证系统','c56e5578-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(3610,180,'GearboxType','String','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'XSD中必填','maxLength=1','28.','DIRECT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT','认证系统','c574d681-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(3611,181,'GearNumber','Short','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:@GearRatioTable=>VALUE IS NUMBERED','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 11:04:24','',NULL,'当车型=M