OfCompletion= C时必填  禁止 where EnergySource  95 当车型=Ox, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','totalDigits=6; fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=9999.99','27.4.','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统','c5690b42-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(4194,347,'MaximumNetPowerElectric','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT IF ANY @EnergySource IN [95]\r\nR2:VALUE IS PRESENT IF ANY @EnergySource IN [95]\r\nR3:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @EnergySource NOT IN [95]','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 15:40:44','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx 且 EnergySource = 95 且 no value specified in Maximum30MinutesPower 且 no value specified in ConsolidatedMaximumNetPowerElectric 且 StageOfCompletion= C 时必填  当车型=Tx, Cx 且 EnergySource = 95 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）时必填  禁止 where EnergySource  95 当车型=Ox, Lx, Rx, Sx时禁止','totalDigits=6; fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=9999.99','27.3.','STRIP_UNIT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统','c56063fc-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(4195,424,'WltpCo2Combined','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @WltpCo2WeightedCombined IS ABSENT AND @EngineCapacity IS PRESENT AND @WltpEmissionTestMass IS PRESENT AND @ClassHybridVehicle IN [/^NOVC/, NULL]\nR2a:VALUE IS ABSENT IF ALL @ClassHybridVehicle = /^OVC/\nR2b:VALUE IS ABSENT IF @WltpCo2WeightedCombined IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 15:40:47','',NULL,'当车型=M1x, M2x, N1x, N2x 且 WltpEmissionTestMass 且 EngineCapacity has a value 且 ClassHybridVehicle starts with NOVC 或 ClassHybridVehicle is not available 且 WltpCo2WeightedCombined has no value 且 完成阶段=C（完整车）, V时必填  禁止 where ClasHybridVehicle starts with OVC 当 WltpCo2WeightedCombined 有值时禁止 当车型=M3x, N3x, Ox, Lx, Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx时禁止','totalDigits=5; fractionDigits=2; min=0.0; max=999.99','49.1.','DIRECT',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT IF','认证系统','c73d832b-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(4196,425,'WltpCo2WeightedCombined','Decimal','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT IF ALL @WltpCo2Combined IS ABSENT AND @EngineCapacity IS PRESENT AND @WltpEmissionTestMass IS PRESENT AND @ClassHybridVehicle