ngAdjustableMax &gt; AxleSpacingAdjustableMin  禁止 for the last axle 当车型=Lx, Tx, Cx时禁止 当 AxleSpacingAdjustable 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=99999','','NULL',34,'AGGREGATE','4.1.','c371ed35-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada'),(4250,141,'MaximumPermissibleLength','Int','vehicle_attribute',NULL,'R1:VALUE IS PRESENT','N','0','admin','2026-05-21 18:41:01','',NULL,'当车型=Mx, Nx, Ox 且 StageOf Completion = I时必填 当车型=Tx, Cx, Rx, Sx 且 MaximumPermissibleLengthMin / MaximumPermissibleLengthMax has no value 且 StageOf Completion = I时必填  当车型=Lx时禁止 当完成阶段=C, V时禁止 当 MaximumPermissibleLengthMin / MaximumPermissibleLengthMax 有值时禁止','min=0.0; max=99999',NULL,'NULL',34,'VALUE IS PRESENT',NULL,'c3baaafc-54c1-11f1-a407-ce42c0656ada');
